PROJECT: WEDDINGGUEST

Smart Indian Wedding Invitation, RSVP & Guest Management Platform

Act as a senior full-stack developer, UI/UX designer, database architect, and product designer.

I want you to build a complete, production-quality web application called WeddingGuest.

The purpose of this platform is to help Indian families organize weddings by sending digital invitations through WhatsApp, collecting guest attendance confirmations, tracking the number of people attending, and calculating how much food needs to be prepared.

The main objective is to reduce unnecessary food preparation, prevent food wastage, simplify wedding planning, and make guest management easier.

This should not look like an ordinary event management website.

It should look and feel like a beautiful, premium, traditional Indian wedding invitation, combined with a modern wedding management application.

